# NOTE: key.properties and keystore/habitflow-release.jks are
# INTENTIONALLY committed (not ignored) - see README.md "Signing / why
# the keystore is committed". This is a personal, non-Play-Store app; a
# stable signing key across every CI build matters more here than
# keeping it secret, since without it every APK is signed differently
# and Android refuses to install an update over the old one without
# uninstalling first - wiping all local habit data. If you fork this for
# your own signed release, generate your own keystore and swap it out.
